Package: becomingfluentindata
Title: Becoming Fluent in Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Marco", "Kuehne", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Source of the bookdown project "Becoming Fluent in Data".
    This file is not a real R package. It exists so that every package the
    book needs can be installed with a single command on a fresh machine:
    remotes::install_deps() or pak::local_install_deps().
